# Options for guildmaster.service. This file is yours: package upgrades do
# not replace it.
#
# GUILDMASTER_OPTS is passed to /usr/bin/guildmaster. Leave it empty to keep
# the upstream default capacity of one token per online processor, plus one.
# To set an explicit capacity, for example two tokens:
#
#   GUILDMASTER_OPTS="--tokens=2"
#
# A change takes effect when the service is next started. Restarting the
# service replaces the token pool; see guildmaster(8) before restarting while
# builds are running.
GUILDMASTER_OPTS=""
